          doctorTip: "A simple 10-minute post-meal stroll recruits GLUT-4 glucose transporters into muscle cells independently of insulin! This is one of the highest-ROI habits in metabolic health. No supplement, no drug, no cost — just walk. Do it after lunch and dinner. Your postprandial glucose will drop 20-35%, insulin demand will plummet, and you'll feel the energy stability within days. Pair with veggie-first eating and you have a glucose-flattening protocol that works better than most medications."
